  // set-103-8-14: UNIFIED — renderer now delegates to the global
  // window.hashToTraits (v3, line ~3078). This was the #1 critical bug:
  // the old local version used hc(19) for mythics (0-15 range, TRAIT_BANK
  // lookup) which could NEVER produce Beholder, Storm Wraith, Ancient Rune
